This repository uses Laravel 12.

Tech stack:

* Laravel 12
* PHP 8.3+
* MariaDB / MySQL
* Filament v4

Project structure:

* Controllers: app/Http/Controllers
* Models: app/Models
* Requests: app/Http/Requests
* Filament resources: app/Filament
* Routes: routes/web.php and routes/api.php
* Migrations: database/migrations

Rules:

* Follow Laravel 12 best practices
* Use Eloquent ORM instead of raw SQL
* Use FormRequest validation
* Follow MVC architecture
* Do not modify vendor files
* Use modern PHP syntax
* Use Filament v4 syntax only
